    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleepy sister's friend is a naughty touching game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player, a brother, starts touching his sister's friend while her friend is sleeping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy to clear so that you can immerse yourself in touching, but you need to play so that your sister's friend does not wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saving is automatic, and there is no penalty for game over, so you can immerse yourself in the game without fear of failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All actions can be performed with a single mouse click.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can rub and lick by selecting the rub button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep rubbing her so as not to wake her up, and new rubbing methods will be added.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you will be able to remove her clothes and underwear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one stage. The ending is unlocked by increasing the parameters. The ending sex is consensual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept of the game is to secretly touch a sleeping woman rather than forcibly touching her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The English is machine translated.</p>",
